2013 年消费最高（合计 2,992,757,755.72 CZK），依据 `yearmonth` 表按年聚合，CZK 过滤取自 `customers.Currency`。

Final Answer: 2013
Evidence SQL: SELECT substr(ym.Date, 1, 4) AS year, SUM(ym.Consumption) AS total FROM yearmonth ym JOIN customers c ON ym.CustomerID = c.CustomerID WHERE c.Currency = 'CZK' GROUP BY substr(ym.Date, 1, 4) ORDER BY total DESC LIMIT 1;
